    "field": "argument_node.pretty",
    "value": "∀ {X : Type u} [inst : MeasurableSpace X] (D : MeasureTheory.Measure X) [MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure D]\n  (m₁ m₂ : ℕ) (Success : Set ((Fin m₁ → X) × (Fin m₂ → X))),\n  MeasurableSet Success →\n    (MeasureTheory.Measure.pi fun x => D) (⇑(splitUsedEquiv✝ m₁ m₂) ⁻¹' Success) =\n      ((MeasureTheory.Measure.pi fun x => D).prod (MeasureTheory.Measure.pi fun x => D)) Success"
  },
